<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n92589" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ῥόδιος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ῥόδος</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>Rhodian, of</i> or <i>from
				Rhodes</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				2.654
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ῥ. τέχνη</span> the art
			of <i>painting,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Anacreont.
				15.3
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ Ῥ</span>. (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χώρα</span>) <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				2.4.3
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥ</span>. (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δραχμή</span>) <i>Rhodian drachma</i>,
			Roussel <i>Cultes Egyptiens</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				p.236
			</span></i> (Delos, <span class="entity">ii B.C.</span>), <i><span class="en">
				<u>Inscr.Délos</u>
				442
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>B</u>
				204
			</span></i> (pl., <span class="entity">ii B.C.</span>): <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ῥόδια,
					τά</span>, a kind of shoes, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>: <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ῥόδιον, τό</span>, sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μέτρον</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ostr.Bodl.</u>
				iii 369
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ostr.Strassb.</u>
				615
			</span></i>-<i><span class="en">
				617
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A.D.)</span>, <u>Ostr.</u>i <i><span class="en">
				p.765
			</span></i>:—cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ῥοδιακός</span>.</div>
